  "solution": {
    "text": "Antihistamines are used to relieve or prevent the symptoms of hay fever and other types of allergy. They work by preventing the effects of a substance called histamine, which is produced by the body. Histamines can cause itching, sneezing, runny nose, and watery eyes. Hence, antihistamines are used as antacid and Antiallergic.",
